# Tuldok project folders are tracked: .tuldok/ metadata and notes always,
# and only the stored files each project's own .gitignore allows (benchmark
# results and model source). The Tuldok database is rebuilt from them.

# Kept on disk for local use, not published: the per-step protocols of the earlier studies,
# the detailed reports the benchmark results were assembled from, the inputs of the retired
# chart scripts, and scene files that surrogate/datasets rebuilds.
/docs/plans/**/*protocol*.json
# ...except the ones that are the settings of a training-set preparation script (see the
# training-sets.json beside the model recipes).
